# Cisco Meraki - direct connection to Cisco's hosted MCP server (https://mcp.meraki.com/mcp)
#
# Conduit users do not need this file: the Dashboard API key is pasted once
# into Conduit's Meraki connection and never lives on your machine.
#
# For direct use, create the key in the Meraki Dashboard under
# Organization > API & Webhooks, ideally as a read-only organization admin.
# The key inherits that admin's permissions.
MERAKI_DASHBOARD_API_KEY=
